# The pending Basilisk ability refers to its blocker, so Deflecting Palm can choose it after it dies (CR 609.7a).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald x2
Thicket Basilisk
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Deflecting Palm
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Phyrexian Walker
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
